+/**                                                        **/
+/**   NAME       : test_common_integer.c                   **/
+/**                                                        **/
+/**   AUTHOR     : Francois PELLEGRINI                     **/
+/**                                                        **/
+/**   FUNCTION   : This module tests the integer reading   **/
+/**                routine of the common module.           **/
+/**                                                        **/
+/**   DATES      : # Version 7.0  : from : 02 nov 2026     **/
+/**                                 to   : 02 nov 2026     **/
+/**                                                        **/
+/************************************************************/
